  "title": "Melissa&#39;s Grandma&#39;s Ginger Lace Cookies",
  "description": "This recipe for Melissa&#39;s Grandma&#39;s ginger lace cookies dates from the WWI era. Hence, there is no butter. They feature a spiced ginger and molasses flavor.",
  "authors": [
