  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1.5 cups shortening",
    "0.5 cup molasses",
    "2 eggs",
    "4 cups all-purpose flour",
    "4 teaspoons baking soda",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "2 teaspoons ground ginger",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sZ7seN8e423ZnXNKMY_xPuBNKKo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274071-melissas-grandmas-ginger-lace-cookies-DDMFS-Step-01-cbdbe15d369f426282b1fe986b4f8026.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274071/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat 2 cups sugar, shortening, and molasses in the bowl of a stand mixer fitted with the paddle attachment until uniform, making sure not to overbeat. Add eggs; beat for 30 seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TMnxeXBuH6pwSWHHN7HRlafw5aE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274071-melissas-grandmas-ginger-lace-cookies-DDMFS-Step-02-06285303568e48adab6f642bf75f1006.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274071/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk flour, baking soda, cinnamon, ginger, and salt together in a separate bowl; beat into sugar mixture until just combined and dough is stiff.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iWquDOH9yYOxcU521sST4bEWFfU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274071-melissas-grandmas-ginger-lace-cookies-DDMFS-Step-03-bf5bdf94b85a4d6c9fc5d5c75bc81bf7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274071/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour 2 tablespoons sugar in a shallow bowl. Roll dough into 1-inch balls; roll in sugar, making sure not to flatten. Place on ungreased cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KSvVqtloNPpmc5r8fzudo_PLRKE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274071-melissas-grandmas-ginger-lace-cookies-DDMFS-Step-04-951cf342147c442b89860d78549f7cb0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274071/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cookies crackle on top for \"lace\" design, 6 to 8 minutes. Cool on cookie sheets for 5 minutes; transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ydb_it-SGTNAnWr58dkxfqpuYS0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/274071-melissas-grandmas-ginger-lace-cookies-DDMFS-Step-05-5dd94c0e05394295a60fd81e8f1db445.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/274071/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
